#: phasex64-panel:278
msgid ""
"Records Out 3/4's own analog output (incl. Direct), not a copy of In 3/4. If "
"you monitor this input back to Out 3/4 in your DAW, disable that track's "
"input monitoring - otherwise it's a feedback loop."
msgstr ""

#: phasex64-panel:282
msgid ""
"Records Out 1/2's own analog output (incl. Direct), not a copy of In 1/2. If "
"you monitor this input back to Out 1/2 in your DAW, disable that track's "
"input monitoring - otherwise it's a feedback loop."
msgstr ""

#: phasex64-panel:286
msgid "Internal sound module (route name in the driver: Sound Module)."
msgstr ""

#: phasex64-panel:287
msgid "Input muted."
